DESCRIPTION:PIT-11 and PIT-R are sent to the tax office by the end of Janua
 ry of the year following the tax year (and PIT-11 to the taxpayer by the e
 nd of February).\nApplies to: Employers and other payers of employment inc
 ome\nNon-working-day rule: check the source.\n\nSource: https://www.podatk
 i.gov.pl/podatki-osobiste/pit/platnik\nDetails: https://www.intelligentpay
 roll.eu/deadlines.html#poland\n\nFor information only\, not legal or tax a
 dvice. Dates follow the recurring rule stated by the source\; weekends and
  holidays are not applied. Sources last checked 5 October 2026.
