DTSTAMP:20261005T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261025
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261026
RRULE:FREQ=MONTHLY;BYMONTHDAY=25
SUMMARY:Romania: Declaration 112 and payment of salary income tax and socia
 l contributions (monthly)
DESCRIPTION:Employers file Form 112 monthly. The ANAF tax calendar sets the
  25th of the following month\, moved to the next working day when it falls
  on a weekend (for example 26 January and 27 April 2026). Payment is due b
 y the same date as the declaration.\nApplies to: Employers and equivalent 
 payers of salary income\nNon-working-day rule: check the source.\n\nSource
 : https://static.anaf.ro/static/10/Anaf/AsistentaContribuabili_r/Calendar/
 Calendar_obligatii_fiscale_2025.htm\nDetails: https://www.intelligentpayro
 ll.eu/deadlines.html#romania\n\nFor information only\, not legal or tax ad
 vice. Dates follow the recurring rule stated by the source\; weekends and 
 holidays are not applied. Sources last checked 5 October 2026.
URL:https://www.intelligentpayroll.eu/deadlines.html#romania
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
