DTSTAMP:20261005T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261026
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261027
RRULE:FREQ=MONTHLY;BYMONTHDAY=26
SUMMARY:Sweden: Employer declaration (arbetsgivardeklaration) - turnover ov
 er SEK 40 million
DESCRIPTION:For employers with turnover above SEK 40 million the declaratio
 n is normally due on the 26th of the month after pay-out\, moved to the ne
 xt working day on a weekend (for example 27 April 2026). Payment is due ea
 rlier\, by the 12th (17th in January).\nApplies to: Employers with turnove
 r over SEK 40 million per income year\nNon-working-day rule: check the sou
 rce.\n\nSource: https://www.skatteverket.se/foretag/arbetsgivare/lamnaarbe
 tsgivardeklaration/narskajaglamnaarbetsgivardeklaration.4.361dc8c15312eff6
 fd13c11.html\nDetails: https://www.intelligentpayroll.eu/deadlines.html#sw
 eden\n\nFor information only\, not legal or tax advice. Dates follow the r
 ecurring rule stated by the source\; weekends and holidays are not applied
 . Sources last checked 5 October 2026.
URL:https://www.intelligentpayroll.eu/deadlines.html#sweden
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
