 ey relate to. New model phased in during 2026\; mandatory for all employer
 s from 1 Jan 2027.\nApplies to: Employers declaring remuneration to Portug
 uese social security\nNon-working-day rule: check the source.\n\nSource: h
 ttps://files.diariodarepublica.pt/1s/2025/12/23600/0000200005.pdf\nDetails
