  deductions.\nApplies to: Employers reporting salary and other income\nNon
 -working day: If the 5th falls on a weekend or a holiday\, the deadline is
  on the first following working day.\n\nSource: https://www.skatteetaten.n
 o/en/business-and-organisation/employer/the-a-melding/deadlines-and-paymen
 t/\nDetails: https://www.intelligentpayroll.eu/deadlines.html#norway\n\nFo
 r information only\, not legal or tax advice. Dates follow the recurring r
