DTSTAMP:20261005T000000Z
DTSTART;VALUE=DATE:20261005
DTEND;VALUE=DATE:20261006
RRULE:FREQ=MONTHLY;BYMONTHDAY=5
SUMMARY:Finland: Employer's separate report to the Incomes Register
DESCRIPTION:File the employer's separate report on health insurance contrib
 utions once a month\, by the fifth day of the calendar month following the
  payday month. Registered employers file it also for months without wages.
 \nApplies to: Employers paying wages (registered employers also for months
  with no wages)\nNon-working day: If the deadline falls on a Saturday\, Su
 nday or other holiday\, the data can be reported on the following business
  day.\n\nSource: https://www.vero.fi/en/businesses-and-corporations/taxes-
 and-charges/being-an-employer/how-to-report-wages-and-employers-contributi
 ons/\nDetails: https://www.intelligentpayroll.eu/deadlines.html#finland\n\
 nFor information only\, not legal or tax advice. Dates follow the recurrin
 g rule stated by the source\; weekends and holidays are not applied. Sourc
 es last checked 5 October 2026.
URL:https://www.intelligentpayroll.eu/deadlines.html#finland
TRANSP:TRANSPARENT
END:VEVENT
