  end of the quarter\, e.g. contributions for the first quarter by 10 April
 .\nApplies to: Employers with an annual payroll up to CHF 200\,000\nNon-wo
 rking-day rule: check the source.\n\nSource: https://www.ahv-iv.ch/p/2.01.
 d\nDetails: https://www.intelligentpayroll.eu/deadlines.html#switzerland\n
